            "headerEntries": [
              "The naga is an 11th-level spellcaster. Its spellcasting ability is Wisdom (spell save {@dc 16}, {@hit 8} to hit with spell attacks), and it needs only verbal components to cast its spells. It has the following cleric spells prepared:"
            ],
            "spells": {
              "0": {
